              "value": "<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Arthur_Hoeber\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Arthur Hoeber\"><span title=\"American artist (1854-1915)\">Arthur Hoeber</span></a></bdi>",
              "source": "commons-desc-page"
